<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cia Telecomunicaciones.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cia Telecomunicaciones.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co said it downgraded Cia Telecomunicaciones de Chile SA to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Cia Telecomunicaciones gained 1/8 to 26 in midday trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
